Wrote the coder-3 label file for Alma Hernandez / voting-rights. Her only relevant record is a No vote on HB2492 (2022), a single-subject bill requiring documentary proof of citizenship to register — exactly rung 5's clause. The No vote establishes opposition to rung 5 but doesn't separate the remaining ID-at-the-polls rungs, so I coded it `v6_blank_reason: "direction-only"` with both the vote page and bill-text page in `rests_on`.
